  'static.sell.createBuyerTail': 'to shop on Vista Express (buyer accounts are separate from seller accounts).',

  'static.affiliate.title': 'Affiliate Program',
  'static.affiliate.intro': 'Vista Express pays partners for sales they send our way. There are two ways to earn: the referral programme, which every shopper can join for free from their account, and the affiliate programme, for publishers, creators and agencies who promote the marketplace on an ongoing basis.',
  'static.affiliate.referralHeading': 'Referral programme',
  'static.affiliate.referralIntro': 'Every registered shopper receives a personal referral code. Share it with friends; when they create an account and complete their first order, you are both rewarded.',
  'static.affiliate.ref1': '€10 for you and €10 off for your friend on their first order, credited as wallet balance once that order is paid for and delivered.',
  'static.affiliate.ref2': '30-day attribution. Your referral is credited if your friend signs up within 30 days of using your code or link.',
  'static.affiliate.ref3': '14-day waiting period. The reward is released after the referred order has completed, which prevents rewards being claimed on cancelled orders.',
  'static.affiliate.ref4': 'One reward per person. Each referred buyer can generate a single reward, and the referred buyer must verify their email address before their order qualifies.',
  'static.affiliate.ref5': 'No monthly cap on referral rewards, and no minimum order value on the referred order.',
  'static.affiliate.ref6': 'Cannot be combined with other platform promotional discounts on the same order.',
  'static.affiliate.refOutro1': 'Find and share your code under',
  'static.affiliate.refOutro2': '. Individual stores also run their own referral campaigns, which you may find on the store page.',
  'static.affiliate.affiliateHeading': 'Affiliate programme',
  'static.affiliate.affiliateIntro': 'Affiliates promote Vista Express across their own channels and earn commission on qualifying sales. Applications are reviewed individually, so commission rates, cookie window and payout schedule are set in your affiliate agreement rather than advertised as a single fixed rate.',
  'static.affiliate.whoHeading': 'Who we work with',
  'static.affiliate.who1': 'Optical and eyewear reviewers, comparison sites and buying guides',
  'static.affiliate.who2': 'Content creators in lifestyle, health, fashion and fitness',
  'static.affiliate.who3': 'Opticians and eye-care professionals with an online audience',
  'static.affiliate.who4': 'Newsletter publishers and deal communities',
  'static.affiliate.howHeading': 'How it works',
  'static.affiliate.how1': 'Send us your website or channel, audience size, main categories and target countries.',
  'static.affiliate.how2': 'We review the application and reply with tracking details and your commission terms.',
  'static.affiliate.how3': 'You share your tracked links through our network.',
  'static.affiliate.how4': 'Qualifying sales are credited to you, and you are paid on the schedule in your agreement.',
